---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Services — AI Inbox + Custom Work | OpsHQ Digital"
  description="One productized service: AI Inbox with a free 30-day pilot. Plus custom development for everything else — CRM, AI agents, websites, cloud — quoted on a free discovery call."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-navy-950 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight mb-6">
          One Productized Service. Custom Builds for Everything Else.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Most businesses don't need a 50-page menu of services. They need one thing that works. We do AI Inbox for wedding venues at a fixed monthly price — and custom-scope work when you need something built around your business.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 bg-blue-500 text-white font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors text-lg">
          Free Discovery Call →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Two cards -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">

        <!-- AI Inbox -->
        <a href="/services/ai-inbox/" class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border-2 border-blue-500 p-8 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-500/10 transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Productized Service</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Free 30-day pilot</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">📧</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-950 mb-3 group-hover:text-blue-500 transition-colors">AI Inbox</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">5-minute first responses to every inquiry, in your business's voice, with human approval on every send. Built for high-touch service businesses — venues, photographers, planners, transport operators, contractors. Free 30-day pilot, cancel anytime.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> 5-min reply SLA across every inquiry</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Human-approval on every send (or auto-send for trusted senders)</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Full audit log + DPA included</li>
          </ul>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-500 group-hover:underline">See pricing &amp; how it works →</span>
        </a>

        <!-- Capabilities -->
        <a href="/capabilities/" class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Custom Work</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Fixed-scope quotes</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🛠️</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-950 mb-3 group-hover:text-blue-500 transition-colors">Custom Builds — Web, Cloud, CRM, AI</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Everything that isn't AI Inbox: custom AI agents, Azure cloud setup, CRM automation, fast SEO-strong websites. Written scope and fixed price after a 30-minute discovery call.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Free discovery, written scope, fixed quote</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Fixed-price quote after the discovery call</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Optional ongoing-care retainer (scoped on the call)</li>
          </ul>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-500 group-hover:underline">See capabilities &amp; how an engagement works →</span>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Explore by service -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-navy-950 mb-8 text-center">Explore by Service</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/services/ai-inbox/" class="flex items-center justify-between bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-5 hover:border-blue-300 hover:shadow-sm transition-all"><span class="font-semibold text-navy-950">AI Inbox — 5-Minute Lead Response</span><span class="text-blue-500">→</span></a>
        <a href="/services/lead-generation/" class="flex items-center justify-between bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-5 hover:border-blue-300 hover:shadow-sm transition-all"><span class="font-semibold text-navy-950">Lead Generation & Response</span><span class="text-blue-500">→</span></a>
        <a href="/services/websites/" class="flex items-center justify-between bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-5 hover:border-blue-300 hover:shadow-sm transition-all"><span class="font-semibold text-navy-950">Small Business Websites</span><span class="text-blue-500">→</span></a>
        <a href="/services/ai-automation/" class="flex items-center justify-between bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-5 hover:border-blue-300 hover:shadow-sm transition-all"><span class="font-semibold text-navy-950">AI Automation</span><span class="text-blue-500">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center mt-8"><a href="/industries/" class="text-blue-500 font-medium hover:underline text-lg">Or see how we help your industry →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bottom CTA -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-navy-950 to-navy-800 text-white py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Not Sure Which Path?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 mb-8">Tell us the problem in your own words. We'll tell you whether AI Inbox fits, a custom build is the answer, or you're better off with someone else.</p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-blue-500 text-white font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors min-h-[44px] text-lg">
        Free Discovery Call
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@graph": [
        {
          "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
          "itemListElement": [
            { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://opshqdigital.com/" },
            { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Services", "item": "https://opshqdigital.com/services/" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "ProfessionalService",
          "name": "OpsHQ Digital",
          "url": "https://opshqdigital.com/services/",
          "provider": { "@id": "https://opshqdigital.com/#organization" },
          "areaServed": { "@type": "City", "name": "Seattle", "addressRegion": "WA" },
          "hasOfferCatalog": {
            "@type": "OfferCatalog",
            "name": "Services",
            "itemListElement": [
              { "@type": "Offer", "itemOffered": { "@type": "Service", "name": "AI Inbox (free 30-day pilot)", "url": "https://opshqdigital.com/services/ai-inbox/" } },
              { "@type": "Offer", "itemOffered": { "@type": "Service", "name": "Custom Web, Cloud, CRM, and AI Builds", "url": "https://opshqdigital.com/capabilities/" } }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    })} />
  </Fragment>
</BaseLayout>

